}}'''Pool''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that that is obtainable in the [[Summer Event 2025]] by purchasing the 8th tier in the Battle Pass for 800  [[Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} in the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]], or through trading.

== Appearance ==
The blade of this knife is an aquatic shade of blue. There are two pool floaties on it. One is a hot pink, while the other is a striped floatie with the colors pink, yellow, and white. The guard is similar to the floaties, and is a bright pink. The handle is a dark shade of black.


